Add a small fake dataset for tests.

Suggested files:

```text
tests/fixtures/laptop_quality/data/nba_players.csv
tests/fixtures/laptop_quality/data/nba_games.csv
```

The fixture should include enough rows to cover:

```text
PTS, REB, AST, STL, BLK, TOV
